<view class="inspection-assist" aria-label="检查辅助草稿">
  <text role="status">{{phase}} · 草稿不代表检查完成</text><text wx:if="{{error}}" role="alert">{{error}}</text>
  <view wx:if="{{originalReceiptObserved}}" role="status">
    <text>已读到原检查收据：{{originalInspectionId}}</text>
    <text wx:if="{{draftLinkStatus === 'not_linked'}}">原检查已提交，草稿关联尚未写回；核对不会重新提交。</text>
    <text wx:elif="{{draftLinkStatus === 'unknown'}}">草稿关联状态未知，请核对原操作。</text>
    <text wx:else>草稿已关联原检查。收据不代表判责或结算结果。</text>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{recognitionSaveObserved}}" role="status">
    <text>已确认原识别候选保存于草稿版本 {{recognitionSavedRevision}}；这是历史保存事实，不表示当前候选可采用或检查已提交。</text>
  </view>
  <button disabled="{{!canReadReceipts}}" bindtap="onReadReceipts">只核对原收据（不读取当前材料）</button>
  <text wx:if="{{mode === 'receipt_only'}}" role="status">历史收据只读模式；不载入当前候选、不授予编辑或再次提交权限。</text>
  <block wx:if="{{mode !== 'receipt_only'}}">
  <ai-task-workbench id="workbench"><ai-inspection-draft slot="inspection-draft" items="{{items}}" missing="{{missing}}" readonly="{{!editable}}" candidate-actions="{{editable}}" revision="{{revision}}" bind:draftchange="onEdit" bind:candidatedecision="onCandidate" /></ai-task-workbench>
  <view aria-label="原识别结果待人工审阅">
    <text role="status">原识别结果：{{recognitionStatus}}。候选未采用，不代表业务事实。</text>
    <view wx:for="{{recognitionItems}}" wx:key="candidateId"><text>{{item.fieldCode}}：{{item.value}} · {{item.status}}</text><text>依据：{{item.sourceLabel}}</text></view>
    <button disabled="{{!canReadRecognition || pending}}" bindtap="onReadRecognition">读取原识别结果</button>
    <button disabled="{{!canSaveRecognition || pending}}" bindtap="onSaveRecognition">保存候选供逐项人工核实</button>
  </view>
  <view wx:for="{{evidence}}" wx:key="attachmentId"><text>{{item.attachmentId}} @ {{item.attachmentRevision}}</text><button disabled="{{!canRemove || pending}}" data-id="{{item.attachmentId}}" bindtap="onRemove">从草稿移除附件</button></view>
  <button disabled="{{pending || phase === 'unavailable'}}" bindtap="onRead">重读原稿</button>
  <button disabled="{{!canReview}}" bindtap="onReview">准备人工审阅材料</button>
  <button disabled="{{!canSubmit}}" bindtap="onSubmit">核实后请求原检查提交</button>
  <button disabled="{{!canReconcile}}" bindtap="onReconcile">核对原操作</button>
  </block>
  <text>识别能力未接通时请使用原人工填单；未知结果不要重复提交。</text>
</view>
